  "fullDescription": "Bring festive functional charm to your 3D printing collection with this 3D Printable Christmas Tree Bowl STL Model. Featuring a bold tree-shaped silhouette with a deep white interior, forest-green trim, and gold-accented corners, this serving bowl blends classic holiday form with practical snack and treat display, making it a standout addition to your Christmas table, party spread, or seasonal centerpiece.\n\nThe distinctive tree outline and elegant color contrast give this bowl real festive presence, turning an everyday serving dish into an eye-catching holiday piece. Its wide, deep bowl shape makes it perfect for holding cookies, candy, nuts, or snack mixes, while its bold seasonal design appeals to anyone who loves statement holiday tableware.\n\nPrint it in forest green with a white interior and gold accent details to bring this Christmas tree bowl to life. This model is a rewarding project for 3D printing enthusiasts who enjoy multi-color prints, functional tableware, and festive seasonal decor.\n\nPerfect For\n\nCookies and holiday treats\nCandy and snack mix display\nChristmas party centerpieces\nHome and event decoration\nHoliday dining and kitchen accents\nFamily gathering serving dishes\nCreative 3D printing projects\nChristmas gift ideas\nFestive tabletop displays\nHoliday hosting essentials\n\nPlease Note: This is a digital 3D model file. No physical product will be shipped. Please check your 3D printer and slicing software compatibility before printing. This 3D model is available only in STL color — if you’d like it colored, you’ll need to open the STL file in separate software to color it yourself. The actual printed product may look slightly different from the product mockup image shown.",
